# The record is durable grain state; losing it with the runner's silo strands every handle.
MODULE: HandleHasRecordLostWithSilo
TARGET: HandleHasRecord
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a silo's death also loses the records of operations it ran
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ alive' = [alive EXCEPT ![s] = FALSE]
    /\ crashes' = crashes + 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<stalls, rejects, handles, launches>>
    /\ UNCHANGED opVars /\ UNCHANGED remVars
--- REPLACE
    /\ alive' = [alive EXCEPT ![s] = FALSE]
    /\ crashes' = crashes + 1
    /\ opState' = [o \in Ops |-> IF opRunner[o] = s THEN "Absent" ELSE opState[o]]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<stalls, rejects, handles, launches>>
    /\ UNCHANGED <<opRunner, opParams, opCancel, opWork, opFollows, opSeen, opOutcome, opResultRem>>
    /\ UNCHANGED remVars
--- END
